record("LegacyPublic30", "{\"id\":\"LegacyPublic30\",\"speaker\":\"Unknown\",\"text\":\"18:36 UTC: [about: one-piece] [about: dressrosa] [about: lucy] [reported: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_season_17] The Dressrosa arc of One Piece is adapted by the anime's season 17: episodes 629 to 746, broadcast from 2014-01-19 to 2016-06-19, covering the end of manga volume 70 to the middle of volume 80. In the manga, volume 71 'Coliseum of Scoundrels' (chapters 701 to 711, released 2013-08-02) holds the Colosseum tournament; chapters 704, 709 and 789 carry 'Lucy' in their titles, and chapter 704 is titled 'Lucy and the Statue of Kyros'.\",\"kind\":\"legacy-journal\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T18:36:00Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"journal.md\",\"session\":\"\",\"channel\":\"\",\"about\":[\"one-piece\",\"dressrosa\",\"lucy\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", LegacyJournal, Json).
