record("LegacyPublic31", "{\"id\":\"LegacyPublic31\",\"speaker\":\"Unknown\",\"text\":\"18:36 UTC: [about: lucy] [about: luffy] [about: dressrosa] [reported: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_season_17] In Dressrosa, Luffy enters the Corrida Colosseum tournament under the alias 'Lucy'. Episode 633 is titled 'A Formidable, Unknown Warrior! Here Comes Lucy!' (he registers as Lucy); in episode 649, 'The Fierce Battle Coming to the End! Lucy vs. Chin Jao!', Lucy defeats Chinjao and wins Block C. The tournament's prize is the Mera Mera no Mi, the Flame-Flame Fruit, once eaten by his brother Ace.\",\"kind\":\"legacy-journal\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T18:36:00Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"journal.md\",\"session\":\"\",\"channel\":\"\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"luffy\",\"dressrosa\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", LegacyJournal, Json).
message("LegacyPublic31", "LegacyJournal", Conversation, "Unknown").
message("LegacyPublic31", "lucy", Conversation, "Unknown").
message("LegacyPublic31", "luffy", Conversation, "Unknown").
message("LegacyPublic31", "dressrosa", Conversation, "Unknown").
date("2026-09-15T18:36:00Z", "LegacyPublic31", "DESKTOP-86I05G4", Utc).
source("journal.md", "LegacyPublic31").
record("LegacyPublic32", "{\"id\":\"LegacyPublic32\",\"speaker\":\"Unknown\",\"text\":\"18:36 UTC: [about: lucy] [about: dressrosa] [about: one-piece] [reported: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_season_17] Luffy did not finish the tournament as Lucy: he let his brother Sabo take up the disguise for the finals. 'Lucy' is announced as the winner, and Sabo eats the Mera Mera no Mi and inherits Ace's power (manga chapter 744; anime episode 678, 'The Fire Fist Strikes! The Flame-Flame Fruit Power Returns!'); in episode 679 Lucy reveals himself to be Sabo, Chief of Staff of the Revolutionary Army, long thought dead. So two people were Lucy, and the name outlived the disguise.\",\"kind\":\"legacy-journal\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T18:36:00Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"journal.md\",\"session\":\"\",\"channel\":\"\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"dressrosa\",\"one-piece\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", LegacyJournal, Json).
message("LegacyPublic32", "LegacyJournal", Conversation, "Unknown").
