source("journal.md", "LegacyPublic32").
record("LegacyPublic33", "{\"id\":\"LegacyPublic33\",\"speaker\":\"Unknown\",\"text\":\"18:36 UTC: [about: lucy] [about: luffy] [about: one-piece] [reported: https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Will_of_D.] The 'D.' in Monkey D. Luffy is one of One Piece's open mysteries, called the Will of D. Eiichiro Oda, asked what it means, answered to read it as 'D' for now and that he would reveal the truth in time; no explanation has been given. Within the story a member of the Five Elders says D. means danger, and the clan of D. has been called God's Archenemy. I hold this as reported by fan reference sites (the One Piece Wiki, TheGamer, Beebom), not as canon I have read.\",\"kind\":\"legacy-journal\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-15T18:36:00Z\",\"host\":\"DESKTOP-86I05G4\",\"source\":\"journal.md\",\"session\":\"\",\"channel\":\"\",\"about\":[\"lucy\",\"luffy\",\"one-piece\"],\"private\":false,\"from\":null,\"kr\":null}", LegacyJournal, Json).
